---
layout: base.njk
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> PERSONAL SECURITY ARCHIVE</div><h1>{{ site.name }}<span>.</span></h1><p class="hero-subtitle">System Hacking <span>·</span> Reversing <span>·</span> Development</p><p class="hero-description">시스템 해킹과 리버싱을 중심으로<br>CTF와 개발 과정에서 배운 것을 기록합니다.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/archive/">기록 살펴보기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/about/">About me <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div>
  <div class="archive-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="art-cross cross-one">+</div><div class="art-cross cross-two">+</div><div class="archive-object"><div class="object-top"><span>{{ site.name }} / archive</span><span>01</span></div><div class="object-symbol">s<span>.</span></div><div class="object-bottom"><span>SECURITY<br>RESEARCH NOTES</span><span>↗</span></div></div><div class="art-caption">A COLLECTION OF THINGS I LEARN.</div></div>
</section>
<div class="interest-strip"><span class="micro-label">EXPLORING</span><span>System Hacking</span><i>+</i><span>Reverse Engineering</span><i>+</i><span>CTF &amp; Wargame</span><i>+</i><span>Development</span></div>
<section class="home-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE ARCHIVE</p><h2>최근 기록<span class="count">{{ collections.posts | length }}</span></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/archive/">전체 글 보기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="post-list">{% for post in collections.posts | take(3) %}{% include 'post-card.njk' %}{% else %}<div class="empty-state"><h3>아직 작성된 글이 없습니다.</h3><p>글을 작성하면 여기에 표시됩니다.</p></div>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="home-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">TOPICS</p><h2>주제별 기록</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/categories/">카테고리 보기 ↗</a></div><div class="topic-grid">{% for category in topics %}<a class="topic-card" href="/categories/{{ category.slug }}/"><div class="topic-top"><span class="micro-label">0{{ loop.index }}</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><h3>{{ category.name }}</h3><p>{{ category.description }}</p><span class="topic-count">{{ collections.posts | inCategory(category.name) | length }}개의 기록</span></a>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="selected-work home-section" aria-labelledby="selected-work-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">SELECTED WORK</p>
      <h2 id="selected-work-title">프로젝트 및 기술 활동</h2>
    </div>
    <a class="text-link" href="{{ site.github }}?tab=repositories" aria-label="GitHub 저장소 목록 보기">GitHub 보기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="project-grid">
    {% for project in projects %}
    <article class="project-card">
      <div class="project-number micro-label">PROJECT 0{{ loop.index }}</div>
      <h3>{{ project.name }}</h3>
      <p>{{ project.description }}</p>
      <ul class="project-stack" aria-label="{{ project.name }} 기술 스택">
        {% for technology in project.stack %}<li>{{ technology }}</li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <div class="project-links">
        <a href="{{ project.repository }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub 저장소 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a href="{{ project.post }}">구축 기록 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
